# Normalize line endings: store and check out all text files with LF.
#
# The toolchain (oxfmt, oxlint) expects LF, and Windows clones with
# core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) would otherwise
# produce CRLF working trees that fail `npm run format:check`.
# Binary files are auto-detected by `text=auto` and are unaffected.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files: cmd.exe expects CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
